2️⃣ Download Maven binary
Visit Maven official download page → copy binary link.
Example (replace version if needed):
wget https://downloads.apache.org/maven/maven-3/3.9.9/binaries/apache-maven-3.9.9-bin.tar.gz -P /tmp
3️⃣ Extract Maven to /opt
sudo tar xf /tmp/apache-maven-3.9.9-bin.tar.gz -C /opt
4️⃣ Create a symbolic link
sudo ln -s /opt/apache-maven-3.9.9 /opt/maven
